cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "InvarLock: Auditable strict verification for edited model checkpoints"
message: "If you use InvarLock in scientific work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
abstract: >
  InvarLock is a baseline-relative evaluation and assurance toolkit for edited model checkpoints.
  It provides paired log-space evaluation against a baseline, layered guards (Spectral, RMT, Variance),
  guard-metric-impact checks, and a machine-readable evaluation report artifact with determinism and provenance.
repository-code: https://github.com/invarlock/invarlock
repository-artifact: https://github.com/invarlock/invarlock/tags
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.12.1
date-released: 2026-07-05
authors:
  - name: "InvarLock"
    affiliation: "InvarLock"
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - model compression and editing
  - quantization
  - robustness
  - evaluation
  - verification
  - evaluation reports
  - release assurance
  - reproducibility
